---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Innovation">
  <h1>Innovation Programme</h1>

  <p class="lead">
    Our innovation work explores integrated models that may reduce waste, improve coordination and support measurable social outcomes. We begin with feasibility, partner mapping and evidence requirements before any pilot is considered.
  </p>

  <div class="grid">
    <section class="card">
      <h2>How a future pilot could be evaluated</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Feasibility</strong> — partner mapping, needs analysis, and operational design</li>
        <li><strong>Prototype</strong> — a proposed pilot with a defined scope and potential KPIs</li>
        <li><strong>Evaluate</strong> — an independent review and impact reporting if delivery proceeds</li>
        <li><strong>Scale</strong> — consider refinement or wider delivery only where evidence supports it</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="card highlight">
      <h2>Innovation Spotlight: Unity House</h2>
      <p>
        Unity House is a proposed public-benefit programme seeking careful exploratory conversations with a potential community host, suitable surplus-resource partner and evaluation partner. Pilot 01 would test hosted surplus-food redistribution without a new kitchen; future branches would be considered only after evidence and partner readiness.
      </p>

      <div class="pillRow">
        <span class="pill">Proposed pilot pathway</span>
        <span class="pill">Potential KPIs</span>
        <span class="pill">Evaluation if delivery proceeds</span>
      </div>

      <p class="note">
        Unity House is not an operating physical centre or active food service. It is a proposed programme under controlled partner discovery, subject to partner fit, safeguards, budget and evidence.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>What a future pilot might measure</h2>
    <div class="kpis">
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpiTop">Efficiency</div>
        <div class="kpiBig">Cost per outcome</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpiTop">Environment</div>
        <div class="kpiBig">Waste reduced</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpiTop">Social</div>
        <div class="kpiBig">Retention & reintegration</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpiTop">Quality</div>
        <div class="kpiBig">Service reliability</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bar">
    <div>
      <h3>Interested in exploring a proposed pilot?</h3>
      <p>
        We welcome discussion with councils, institutions and community partners about whether a proposed pilot could have clear governance, transparent reporting and appropriate measures.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Contact</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/unity-house">Read the Pilot 01 outline</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/governance">Governance</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 40px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .lead {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      font-size: 18px;
      max-width: 90ch;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .card ol {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(39, 99, 235, 0.06), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.06));
    }

    .pillRow {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .pill {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .kpis {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .kpi {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: rgba(39, 99, 235, 0.04);
    }

    .kpiTop {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .kpiBig {
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .bar {
      margin-top: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .bar h3 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text);
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .bar p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 80ch;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: white;
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .btn.primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(39, 99, 235, 0.10), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.10));
      border-color: rgba(39, 99, 235, 0.25);
    }

    .btn:hover {
      border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .kpis { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .bar { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .kpis { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
